<title>USA: Chemfab Corp expands repurchase program.</title>
<headline>Chemfab Corp expands repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>MERRIMACK, N.H. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemfab Corp said on Thursday that its directors had authorized the expansion of its share repurchase program by 200,000 shares a year.</p>
<p>Since June 30, the company said in a statement, management has been authorized to repurchase up to 600,000 shares of the company's common stock during any one fiscal year. The previous cap on repurchased shares was 400,000 a year, the engineered products company said.</p>
